Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:13:41.00,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 美网 女单 16 强
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:13:41.00,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}郑钦文 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}5 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}3{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 斯瓦泰克 · 赛后新闻发布会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.80,0:00:04.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.80,0:00:04.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:04.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:04.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:07.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Impressive two set win including
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:07.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,直落两盘 赢得很漂亮 尤其是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.12,0:00:08.48,EN,,0,0,0,,that first set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.12,0:00:08.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.48,0:00:10.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Your thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.48,0:00:10.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你怎么看？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:12.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:12.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:15.52,EN,,0,0,0,,I've been expecting like really tough match
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:15.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一直觉得会是一场硬仗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.52,0:00:19.12,EN,,0,0,0,,today and also I'm happy to win two set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.52,0:00:19.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天 也很高兴能两盘拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:20.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean it's really difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:20.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说 这真的很难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.40,0:00:21.84,EN,,0,0,0,,to do that against Iga
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.40,0:00:21.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,对上斯瓦泰克做到这点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:24.32,EN,,0,0,0,,because she's a wonderful player.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:24.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为她是个很棒的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:25.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:25.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:26.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:26.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,再次恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:28.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Questions please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:28.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,请提问
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:30.16,EN,,0,0,0,,David,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:30.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.16,0:00:31.04,EN,,0,0,0,,congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.16,0:00:31.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:31.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Obviously,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:31.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,显然
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:33.60,EN,,0,0,0,,being down low five is not an ideal situation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:33.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,0-5 落后不是个理想的处境
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:35.36,EN,,0,0,0,,to be in, but did the experience
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:35.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,但那次经历
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.36,0:00:37.28,EN,,0,0,0,,of having come back from that deficit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.36,0:00:37.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,从这么大的落后追回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.28,0:00:38.64,EN,,0,0,0,,against Madison the previous
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.28,0:00:38.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,上一轮对凯斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.64,0:00:40.40,EN,,0,0,0,,round give you any encouragement
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.64,0:00:40.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,有没有给你一点鼓励
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.40,0:00:42.64,EN,,0,0,0,,to do the same thing today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.40,0:00:42.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天也这么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.64,0:00:45.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.64,0:00:45.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:48.08,EN,,0,0,0,,but I would say I start the match really slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:48.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我得说 我开局特别慢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.08,0:00:50.72,EN,,0,0,0,,That's why she's able to lead 5-0.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.08,0:00:50.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以她才能 5-0 领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.72,0:00:54.32,EN,,0,0,0,,And after that, I start to play more freely,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.72,0:00:54.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,之后 我开始打得放开一些
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:57.04,EN,,0,0,0,,let's say, because I think I need to try to find
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:57.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢 因为我得试着找到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.04,0:00:59.28,EN,,0,0,0,,my rhythm at least for the second set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.04,0:00:59.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,自己的节奏 至少在第二盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:01:01.92,EN,,0,0,0,,But somehow I felt really comfortable
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:01:01.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,但不知怎么 我感觉很舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:04.72,EN,,0,0,0,,on court and in one moment I also lose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:04.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,在场上 有一刻我甚至
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.72,0:01:06.80,EN,,0,0,0,,the score because I'm so focused
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.72,0:01:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,忘了比分 因为我太专注了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:08.88,EN,,0,0,0,,to playing every single point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:08.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一分都想打好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.88,0:01:10.56,EN,,0,0,0,,And I think that's the key for me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.88,0:01:10.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得这对我来说是关键
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.56,0:01:12.08,EN,,0,0,0,,to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.56,0:01:12.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,让我追了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.08,0:01:15.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect that today,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.08,0:01:15.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天我没想到会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.04,0:01:17.20,EN,,0,0,0,,but somehow it's just happening again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.04,0:01:17.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,但不知怎么 又发生了一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.20,0:01:17.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.20,0:01:17.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.68,0:01:19.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.68,0:01:19.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.76,0:01:21.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I wanted to ask you about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.76,0:01:21.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想问的就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.12,0:01:22.00,EN,,0,0,0,,You mentioned that also
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.12,0:01:22.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,你刚才也提到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.00,0:01:23.76,EN,,0,0,0,,that you forgot the score.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.00,0:01:23.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,说你忘了比分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.76,0:01:24.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.76,0:01:24.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:27.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Like did you think it was 53 or did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:27.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你以为是 5-3 吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.12,0:01:29.68,EN,,0,0,0,,How did you mean you forgot what it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.12,0:01:29.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,忘了比分是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.68,0:01:33.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Yes. So at 45 I went to the towel
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.68,0:01:33.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 4-5 的时候我去擦汗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.44,0:01:35.44,EN,,0,0,0,,because I thought yes it was 35
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.44,0:01:35.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我以为是 3-5
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.44,0:01:36.72,EN,,0,0,0,,and I thought I need
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.44,0:01:36.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我以为我还要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.72,0:01:38.80,EN,,0,0,0,,to play one more game but when I saw
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.72,0:01:38.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,再打一局 但我看到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:40.80,EN,,0,0,0,,the scoreboard I was like four five I need
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:40.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,记分牌 才知道是 4-5
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.80,0:01:43.60,EN,,0,0,0,,to go to my place to sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.80,0:01:43.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我得回座位坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.60,0:01:44.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Because I was so
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.60,0:01:44.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我太投入
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:46.48,EN,,0,0,0,,focusing every single point
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:46.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一分都全神贯注
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.48,0:01:48.48,EN,,0,0,0,,so I I couldn't even remember the score.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.48,0:01:48.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我连比分都记不住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.48,0:01:50.80,EN,,0,0,0,,So I just say okay this ball have to play here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.48,0:01:50.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就想 这个球打这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:52.80,EN,,0,0,0,,that ball there next point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:52.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,那个球打那儿 下一分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:54.24,EN,,0,0,0,,So just keep repeating.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:54.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,就这么一直重复
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.24,0:01:56.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.24,0:01:56.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.56,0:01:57.92,EN,,0,0,0,,congratulations Qinwen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.56,0:01:57.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜郑钦文
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.92,0:01:59.52,EN,,0,0,0,,I remember at the French Open
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.92,0:01:59.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我记得在法网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.52,0:02:01.20,EN,,0,0,0,,in that in that really tough loss you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.52,0:02:01.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,那场非常难受的失利
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:03.20,EN,,0,0,0,,have had and you were so emotional after.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:03.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,赛后你情绪很激动
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:06.48,EN,,0,0,0,,I wonder if then you you had any sense
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:06.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想知道你当时有没有想过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.48,0:02:08.64,EN,,0,0,0,,that even though it was a frustrating loss
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.48,0:02:08.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,虽然那场输得很难受
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.64,0:02:10.08,EN,,0,0,0,,that you would be back
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.64,0:02:10.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,但你会这么快
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:12.16,EN,,0,0,0,,to where you wanted to be this soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:12.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,回到你想去的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:14.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it feels long to you but it it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:14.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,对你来说肯定觉得很久
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.24,0:02:17.04,EN,,0,0,0,,hasn't it's you know just been a a summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.24,0:02:17.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,但其实也就一个夏天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.04,0:02:19.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That loss for me is one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.04,0:02:19.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 那场失利对我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.44,0:02:21.92,EN,,0,0,0,,of the toughest for me to accept it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.44,0:02:21.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,是最难接受的一场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.92,0:02:25.60,EN,,0,0,0,,because I got lot of chance in that match.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.92,0:02:25.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为那场我有很多机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.60,0:02:27.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Even right now for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.60,0:02:27.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,哪怕到今天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:28.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I could remember how I missed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:28.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还记得自己是怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.64,0:02:30.32,EN,,0,0,0,,those chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.64,0:02:30.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,错过那些机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.32,0:02:34.72,EN,,0,0,0,,But I think those losses maybe is necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.32,0:02:34.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我觉得这些失利也许有必要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.72,0:02:36.08,EN,,0,0,0,,for me to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.72,0:02:36.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,才能让我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.08,0:02:38.32,EN,,0,0,0,,I need to stay humble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.08,0:02:38.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我得保持谦逊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.32,0:02:40.48,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, I need to continue work hard
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.32,0:02:40.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我得继续努力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.48,0:02:42.72,EN,,0,0,0,,to come back to my spot
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.48,0:02:42.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,才能回到我原来的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.72,0:02:44.56,EN,,0,0,0,,because I felt sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.72,0:02:44.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我觉得 在体育里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:48.40,EN,,0,0,0,,there is no gift if you stop working hard
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:48.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,不努力 就没有白给的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:50.80,EN,,0,0,0,,the result shows everything so I need
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:50.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,成绩就说明一切了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.80,0:02:54.96,EN,,0,0,0,,to in that moment to heal myself
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.80,0:02:54.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以那时候我得治愈自己
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.96,0:02:58.24,EN,,0,0,0,,for quite long time little by little find myself
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.96,0:02:58.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,花了挺长时间 一点点找回自己
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.24,0:03:00.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and also I'm not winning still
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.24,0:03:00.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且我还是赢不了球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.40,0:03:02.32,EN,,0,0,0,,after that and I just need
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.40,0:03:02.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,那之后 我只需要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.32,0:03:04.16,EN,,0,0,0,,to accept it keep working hard
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.32,0:03:04.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,接受它 继续努力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:06.64,EN,,0,0,0,,and let's see when is my moment
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:06.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,看看什么时候是我的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:09.36,EN,,0,0,0,,when I can come back again but I always
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:09.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,什么时候能再回来 但我一直
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.36,0:03:11.84,EN,,0,0,0,,have the confidence of myself I will be there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.36,0:03:11.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,对自己有信心 我一定会回去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.84,0:03:15.68,EN,,0,0,0,,but it's just matter of when of course I
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.84,0:03:15.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,只是时间早晚的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.68,0:03:21.64,EN,,0,0,0,,won't happen not so long you know
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.68,0:03:21.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然 不会太久
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:24.40,EN,,0,0,0,,congratulations I wanted to ask you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:24.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜 我想问你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.40,0:03:25.36,EN,,0,0,0,,about your training block
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.40,0:03:25.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,关于你的封闭训练
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.36,0:03:28.16,EN,,0,0,0,,that you had before before coming here
