Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.00,0:07:43.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I think I can go a bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.00,0:07:43.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得我还能再走远一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.04,0:07:44.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
