Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.36,0:08:26.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你怎么看这场球？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.16,0:08:30.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I think both they are really tough opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.16,0:08:30.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得她们两个都很难打
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.24,0:08:32.64,EN,,0,0,0,,they had a grand slam winner
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.24,0:08:32.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,她们都拿过大满贯冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.64,0:08:35.92,EN,,0,0,0,,before and doesn't matter who I play
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.64,0:08:35.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,不管我碰上的是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.92,0:08:39.20,EN,,0,0,0,,against I just going to give my 100%
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.92,0:08:39.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我都会拿出 100% 去打
