Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.04,0:09:06.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,最大的挑战具体是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:07.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I think in the baseline,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:07.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得在底线上
