Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.48,0:09:22.32,EN,,0,0,0,,So that's going to makes the challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.48,0:09:22.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以这会是个挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.32,0:09:23.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.32,0:09:23.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.04,0:09:24.80,EN,,0,0,0,,And then against Rybakina,
