Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.96,0:10:30.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的拼图都在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.40,0:10:32.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Like in my tennis, I have all the pieces there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.40,0:10:32.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,就像我的网球 拼图全都在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.88,0:10:35.92,EN,,0,0,0,,It's just I didn't put them together yet
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.88,0:10:35.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,只是我还没把它们拼起来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.92,0:10:38.72,EN,,0,0,0,,or I didn't find a way to put them together,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.92,0:10:38.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,或者说我还没找到拼的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.72,0:10:40.96,EN,,0,0,0,,but all the pieces are there.
