Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.84,0:10:59.76,EN,,0,0,0,,these that's mean pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.84,0:10:59.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个 意思就是拼图
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.76,0:11:00.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.76,0:11:00.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.88,0:11:06.48,EN,,0,0,0,,But was a really really hard block
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.88,0:11:06.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,但那真的是特别苦的一段
