Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.68,0:11:19.36,EN,,0,0,0,,did with him honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.68,0:11:19.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话 是跟他一起练
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.36,0:11:19.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.36,0:11:19.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.68,0:11:20.48,EN,,0,0,0,,All right. Last two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.68,0:11:20.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 最后两个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.48,0:11:23.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Please be direct. Tammani and then Doug.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.48,0:11:23.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,请直接提问 塔玛尼 然后道格
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.36,0:11:24.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.36,0:11:24.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:25.36,EN,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:25.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.36,0:11:27.28,EN,,0,0,0,,this is your third US Open quarterfinal
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.36,0:11:27.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是你第 3 次进美网 8 强
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.28,0:11:28.96,EN,,0,0,0,,but given you know everything you've
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.28,0:11:28.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,但你前面讲的这些
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:31.28,EN,,0,0,0,,explained I imagine it's quite a unique
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:31.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想这对你来说挺特别
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.28,0:11:32.96,EN,,0,0,0,,experience for you coming from qualifying
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.28,0:11:32.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,从资格赛一路打上来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.96,0:11:33.44,EN,,0,0,0,,as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.96,0:11:33.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.44,0:11:34.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm curious have have you learned
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.44,0:11:34.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想问 你有没有学到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.80,0:11:36.24,EN,,0,0,0,,anything new about yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.80,0:11:36.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,关于自己的新东西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.24,0:11:38.96,EN,,0,0,0,,or or not during this period.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.24,0:11:38.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这段时间里 还是没有
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.96,0:11:41.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh, I learned a lot about myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.96,0:11:41.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我学到很多 关于我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:44.96,EN,,0,0,0,,about tennis, about life, about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:44.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,关于网球 关于生活 关于一切
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.96,0:11:46.80,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.96,0:11:46.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道 对我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.80,0:11:49.68,EN,,0,0,0,,losing a match is not just about tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.80,0:11:49.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,输一场球不只是网球的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.68,0:11:51.76,EN,,0,0,0,,It's more about something with yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.68,0:11:51.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,更多是你自己身上的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.76,0:11:54.08,EN,,0,0,0,,And also when you're winning a match,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.76,0:11:54.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有你赢下一场球的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.08,0:11:56.48,EN,,0,0,0,,you know exactly what you did right
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.08,0:11:56.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,你很清楚自己做对了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.48,0:11:57.60,EN,,0,0,0,,to win this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.48,0:11:57.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,才赢下这场球
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.60,0:11:57.92,EN,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.60,0:11:57.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.92,0:12:00.00,EN,,0,0,0,,all the process you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.92,0:12:00.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,你走过的整个过程
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.00,0:12:01.92,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, all the single point,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.00,0:12:01.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道 每一分
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.92,0:12:04.72,EN,,0,0,0,,what you thinking of in in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.92,0:12:04.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,你脑子里在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.72,0:12:06.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I would say right now
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.72,0:12:06.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得眼下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.08,0:12:08.40,EN,,0,0,0,,the most important challenge for me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.08,0:12:08.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说最重要的挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.40,0:12:12.64,EN,,0,0,0,,is to keep this humble and then be there
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.40,0:12:12.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是保持谦逊 然后待在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.64,0:12:17.12,EN,,0,0,0,,fight like I have nothing okay I come
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.64,0:12:17.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,就当自己什么都没有那样拼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.12,0:12:20.64,EN,,0,0,0,,from the quality this time so I say
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.12,0:12:20.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我这次从资格赛上来 所以我说
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.64,0:12:24.80,EN,,0,0,0,,to myself the reality is you are just 125
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.64,0:12:24.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,现实就是 你不过就是第 125
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.80,0:12:26.96,EN,,0,0,0,,so you are not the top 10 you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.80,0:12:26.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以你不是世界前 10 了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.96,0:12:29.12,EN,,0,0,0,,were before don't treat yourself so high you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.96,0:12:29.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,以前是 别把自己看那么高
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:31.44,EN,,0,0,0,,are here as everyone else you start
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:31.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,你在这儿和大家一样 你也是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.44,0:12:34.24,EN,,0,0,0,,from this the ground so stay there
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.44,0:12:34.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,都从最底下开始 所以待在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.24,0:12:35.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.24,0:12:35.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,接着拼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.36,0:12:35.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.36,0:12:35.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.68,0:12:37.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay. Last question in English, Doug.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.68,0:12:37.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 最后一个英文提问 道格
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.52,0:12:39.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Obviously, players have periods
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.52,0:12:39.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,球员肯定都会有一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.44,0:12:41.76,EN,,0,0,0,,of confidence up and confidence down
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.44,0:12:41.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,信心高的时候和低的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.76,0:12:44.24,EN,,0,0,0,,and it's part of the pieces of the puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.76,0:12:44.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,这也是拼图的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:47.28,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I'm just curious, what is your idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:47.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我想问 你怎么看？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.28,0:12:49.36,EN,,0,0,0,,What is your definition of confidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.28,0:12:49.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,你怎么定义信心？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.36,0:12:50.88,EN,,0,0,0,,And when did you start
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.36,0:12:50.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是从什么时候开始
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.88,0:12:52.08,EN,,0,0,0,,to feel it coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.88,0:12:52.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,觉得它回来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.08,0:12:53.28,EN,,0,0,0,,If it was in this tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.08,0:12:53.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,是在这站比赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.28,0:12:56.00,EN,,0,0,0,,or before the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.28,0:12:56.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是在这之前
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:59.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, my confidence is always there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:59.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的信心一直都在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.92,0:13:02.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Even I've been lost this three four months.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.92,0:13:02.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,哪怕我输了三四个月
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.88,0:13:05.36,EN,,0,0,0,,My confidence is always inside me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.88,0:13:05.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的信心一直在我心里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:07.52,EN,,0,0,0,,because I always know what I'm capable
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:07.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我一直知道自己能
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:08.48,EN,,0,0,0,,to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:08.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,做到什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.48,0:13:09.84,EN,,0,0,0,,It's just I need to show
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.48,0:13:09.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,只是我需要打给人看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.84,0:13:14.88,EN,,0,0,0,,that and sometimes the tricky things
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.84,0:13:14.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时候难的地方是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.88,0:13:18.72,EN,,0,0,0,,is I cannot show I'm so confidence
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.88,0:13:18.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不能表现得太自信
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.72,0:13:20.56,EN,,0,0,0,,because you lose a match
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.72,0:13:20.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为你输了球
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.56,0:13:22.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and people doesn't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.56,0:13:22.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,别人不喜欢那样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.32,0:13:24.48,EN,,0,0,0,,And also I try
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.32,0:13:24.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也会试着
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.48,0:13:28.88,EN,,0,0,0,,to tell myself okay stay stay calm stay calm
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.48,0:13:28.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟自己说 冷静 冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.88,0:13:30.24,EN,,0,0,0,,but I always say
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.88,0:13:30.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我一直说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.24,0:13:32.00,EN,,0,0,0,,without confidence you cannot win
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.24,0:13:32.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,没有信心你赢不了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.00,0:13:32.80,EN,,0,0,0,,a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.00,0:13:32.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,一场球
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.80,0:13:34.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I had lot of tough match
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.80,0:13:34.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我打过很多硬仗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.64,0:13:36.80,EN,,0,0,0,,in the qualies tough match here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.64,0:13:36.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,资格赛里 这儿也是硬仗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.80,0:13:37.52,EN,,0,0,0,,I think it's
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.80,0:13:37.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.52,0:13:39.52,EN,,0,0,0,,because those confidence helps me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.52,0:13:39.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为是那份信心帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:41.90,EN,,0,0,0,,to get those match.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:41.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,拿下了那些球
